<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cardinal Health cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cardinal Health cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said it downgraded Cardinal Health Inc to outperform from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Cardinal Health closed Wednesday at 59-3/4.</p>
</text>
